{"seq":2,"slug":"query-plans","title":"执行计划解读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/performance-tuning/query-plans","wordCount":816,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"执行计划解读\">执行计划解读</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>执行计划（Query Plan）是数据库优化器为 SQL 查询制定的执行方案，描述了数据库如何访问表、如何连接、如何排序以完成查询。阅读执行计划是 SQL 性能调优的基本功——不看执行计划的优化等于盲人摸象。EXPLAIN 命令是获取执行计划的标准工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SQL 语句] --&gt; B[解析器 Parser]&#10;    B --&gt; C[重写器 Rewriter]&#10;    C --&gt; D[优化器 Planner]&#10;    D --&gt; E[执行计划]&#10;    E --&gt; F[执行器 Executor]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 优化器决策&#10;        D --&gt; G[访问路径选择]&#10;        D --&gt; H[连接顺序]&#10;        D --&gt; I[连接算法]&#10;        D --&gt; J[排序策略]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    G --&gt; G1[顺序扫描 Seq Scan]&#10;    G --&gt; G2[索引扫描 Index Scan]&#10;    G --&gt; G3[位图扫描 Bitmap Scan]\">graph TD\n    A[SQL 语句] --&gt; B[解析器 Parser]\n    B --&gt; C[重写器 Rewriter]\n    C --&gt; D[优化器 Planner]\n    D --&gt; E[执行计划]\n    E --&gt; F[执行器 Executor]\n\n    subgraph 优化器决策\n        D --&gt; G[访问路径选择]\n        D --&gt; H[连接顺序]\n        D --&gt; I[连接算法]\n        D --&gt; J[排序策略]\n    end\n\n    G --&gt; G1[顺序扫描 Seq Scan]\n    G --&gt; G2[索引扫描 Index Scan]\n    G --&gt; G3[位图扫描 Bitmap Scan]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>EXPLAIN 模式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>输出内容</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>EXPLAIN query</td>\n<td>估算成本和行数</td>\n<td>快速检查计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ANALYZE</td>\n<td>EXPLAIN ANALYZE query</td>\n<td>实际执行时间和行数</td>\n<td>精确性能分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BUFFERS</td>\n<td>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)</td>\n<td>I/O 统计</td>\n<td>定位 I/O 瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VERBOSE</td>\n<td>EXPLAIN (VERBOSE)</td>\n<td>输出列详情</td>\n<td>调试列选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FORMAT JSON</td>\n<td>EXPLAIN (FORMAT JSON)</td>\n<td>JSON 格式</td>\n<td>工具解析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"扫描算子\">扫描算子</h2><p>扫描算子是执行计划的叶子节点，决定了如何从表中读取数据。选择哪种扫描方式取决于过滤条件的选择率和索引可用性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const scanOperators = `&#10;-- 顺序扫描（Seq Scan）：逐行读取整张表&#10;EXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT * FROM orders WHERE amount &gt; 0;&#10;-- Seq Scan on orders  (cost=0.00..15406.00 rows=500000 width=32)&#10;--   Filter: (amount &gt; 0)&#10;--   Rows Removed by Filter: 1000&#10;&#10;-- 索引扫描（Index Scan）：通过索引定位后回表读取&#10;EXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT * FROM orders WHERE order_id = 12345;&#10;-- Index Scan using orders_pkey on orders  (cost=0.42..8.44 rows=1 width=32)&#10;--   Index Cond: (order_id = 12345)&#10;&#10;-- 仅索引扫描（Index Only Scan）：只读索引，不回表&#10;EXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT user_id FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100;&#10;-- Index Only Scan using idx_orders_user_id on orders  (cost=0.42..4.44 rows=10 width=8)&#10;--   Index Cond: (user_id = 100)&#10;--   Heap Fetches: 0  -- 关键指标：0 表示完全不回表&#10;&#10;-- 位图扫描（Bitmap Index Scan + Bitmap Heap Scan）&#10;-- 适用于中等选择率，批量收集行位置再访问表&#10;EXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT * FROM orders WHERE status IN (1, 2, 3);&#10;-- Bitmap Heap Scan on orders&#10;--   Recheck Cond: (status = ANY (&#39;{1,2,3}&#39;))&#10;--   -&gt; Bitmap Index Scan on idx_orders_status&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> scanOperators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 顺序扫描（Seq Scan）：逐行读取整张表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT * FROM orders WHERE amount > 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Seq Scan on orders  (cost=0.00..15406.00 rows=500000 width=32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   Filter: (amount > 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   Rows Removed by Filter: 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 索引扫描（Index Scan）：通过索引定位后回表读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT * FROM orders WHERE order_id = 12345;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Index Scan using orders_pkey on orders  (cost=0.42..8.44 rows=1 width=32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   Index Cond: (order_id = 12345)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 仅索引扫描（Index Only Scan）：只读索引，不回表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT user_id FROM orders WHERE user_id = 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Index Only Scan using idx_orders_user_id on orders  (cost=0.42..4.44 rows=10 width=8)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   Index Cond: (user_id = 100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   Heap Fetches: 0  -- 关键指标：0 表示完全不回表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 位图扫描（Bitmap Index Scan + Bitmap Heap Scan）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 适用于中等选择率，批量收集行位置再访问表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT * FROM orders WHERE status IN (1, 2, 3);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Bitmap Heap Scan on orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   Recheck Cond: (status = ANY ('{1,2,3}'))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   -> Bitmap Index Scan on idx_orders_status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扫描类型</th>\n<th>何时使用</th>\n<th>选择率</th>\n<th>I/O 模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Seq Scan</td>\n<td>大部分行需要返回</td>\n<td>&gt; 10-20%</td>\n<td>顺序读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Index Scan</td>\n<td>少量行需要返回</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%</td>\n<td>随机读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Index Only Scan</td>\n<td>索引包含所有需要的列</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%</td>\n<td>随机读（索引内）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bitmap Scan</td>\n<td>中等选择率或多条件</td>\n<td>5-20%</td>\n<td>批量随机读</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"连接算子\">连接算子</h2><p>连接算子决定了两个表（或中间结果）如何组合。优化器根据表大小、索引可用性和统计信息选择最优算法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const joinOperators = `&#10;-- Nested Loop Join：小表驱动大表，内层有索引&#10;EXPLAIN ANALYZE &#10;SELECT o.*, u.username &#10;FROM orders o &#10;JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.user_id&#10;WHERE o.order_id &lt; 100;&#10;-- Nested Loop  (cost=0.71..812.79 rows=100)&#10;--   -&gt; Index Scan using orders_pkey on orders  (cost=0.29..8.43 rows=100)&#10;--   -&gt; Index Scan using users_pkey on users  (cost=0.42..8.44 rows=1)&#10;&#10;-- Hash Join：大表等值连接，无合适索引&#10;EXPLAIN ANALYZE &#10;SELECT o.*, u.username &#10;FROM orders o &#10;JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.user_id;&#10;-- Hash Join  (cost=1500.00..25000.00 rows=500000)&#10;--   Hash Cond: (o.user_id = u.user_id)&#10;--   -&gt; Seq Scan on orders&#10;--   -&gt; Hash&#10;--        -&gt; Seq Scan on users&#10;&#10;-- Merge Join：两个大表，数据已排序&#10;EXPLAIN ANALYZE &#10;SELECT a.*, b.* &#10;FROM large_table_a a &#10;JOIN large_table_b b ON a.sort_key = b.sort_key;&#10;-- Merge Join  (cost=...)&#10;--   Merge Cond: (a.sort_key = b.sort_key)&#10;--   -&gt; Index Scan using idx_a_sort_key on large_table_a&#10;--   -&gt; Index Scan using idx_b_sort_key on large_table_b&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> joinOperators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Nested Loop Join：小表驱动大表，内层有索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXPLAIN ANALYZE </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT o.*, u.username </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders o </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE o.order_id &#x3C; 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Nested Loop  (cost=0.71..812.79 rows=100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   -> Index Scan using orders_pkey on orders  (cost=0.29..8.43 rows=100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   -> Index Scan using users_pkey on users  (cost=0.42..8.44 rows=1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Hash Join：大表等值连接，无合适索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXPLAIN ANALYZE </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT o.*, u.username </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders o </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.user_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Hash Join  (cost=1500.00..25000.00 rows=500000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   Hash Cond: (o.user_id = u.user_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   -> Seq Scan on orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   -> Hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--        -> Seq Scan on users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Merge Join：两个大表，数据已排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXPLAIN ANALYZE </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT a.*, b.* </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM large_table_a a </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">JOIN large_table_b b ON a.sort_key = b.sort_key;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Merge Join  (cost=...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   Merge Cond: (a.sort_key = b.sort_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   -> Index Scan using idx_a_sort_key on large_table_a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   -> Index Scan using idx_b_sort_key on large_table_b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>构建阶段</th>\n<th>探测阶段</th>\n<th>最佳条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Nested Loop</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>内层每行索引查找</td>\n<td>外层结果少 + 内层有索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hash Join</td>\n<td>构建小表哈希表</td>\n<td>逐行探测</td>\n<td>大表等值连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Merge Join</td>\n<td>两侧排序</td>\n<td>双指针遍历</td>\n<td>已排序数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键指标解读\">关键指标解读</h2><p>执行计划中的成本和统计信息是判断性能瓶颈的关键依据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const keyMetrics = `&#10;EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS, FORMAT TEXT)&#10;SELECT u.username, COUNT(*) AS order_count&#10;FROM users u&#10;JOIN orders o ON u.user_id = o.user_id&#10;WHERE o.created_at &gt;= &#39;2024-01-01&#39;&#10;GROUP BY u.username&#10;ORDER BY order_count DESC&#10;LIMIT 10;&#10;&#10;-- 关键指标解读：&#10;-- cost=0.00..15406.00 &#10;--   0.00 = 启动成本（返回第一行前的开销）&#10;--   15406.00 = 总成本（返回所有行的开销）&#10;&#10;-- rows=500000&#10;--   估算返回行数（基于统计信息）&#10;&#10;-- actual time=0.015..125.432&#10;--   实际执行时间（毫秒）&#10;&#10;-- Buffers: shared hit=1234 read=56&#10;--   hit = 缓存命中页数&#10;--   read = 磁盘读取页数&#10;--   高 read 值表示缓存不足&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> keyMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS, FORMAT TEXT)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.username, COUNT(*) AS order_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">JOIN orders o ON u.user_id = o.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE o.created_at >= '2024-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY u.username</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY order_count DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LIMIT 10;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 关键指标解读：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- cost=0.00..15406.00 </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   0.00 = 启动成本（返回第一行前的开销）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   15406.00 = 总成本（返回所有行的开销）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- rows=500000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   估算返回行数（基于统计信息）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- actual time=0.015..125.432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   实际执行时间（毫秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Buffers: shared hit=1234 read=56</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   hit = 缓存命中页数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   read = 磁盘读取页数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--   高 read 值表示缓存不足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>cost</td>\n<td>优化器估算的相对开销</td>\n<td>起始成本高 → 排序/哈希耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>rows</td>\n<td>估算/实际行数</td>\n<td>估算偏差大 → 统计信息过时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>actual time</td>\n<td>实际执行毫秒数</td>\n<td>总时间 vs 各节点时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Buffers shared hit</td>\n<td>缓存命中页数</td>\n<td>高命中率 → I/O 效率好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Buffers shared read</td>\n<td>磁盘读取页数</td>\n<td>高读取 → I/O 瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rows Removed by Filter</td>\n<td>被过滤丢弃的行</td>\n<td>值很大 → 缺少索引</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"常见性能问题诊断\">常见性能问题诊断</h2><p>通过执行计划可以快速定位几类常见的性能问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const diagnosisPatterns = `&#10;-- 问题 1：估算行数严重偏差 → 需要更新统计信息&#10;ANALYZE orders;  -- 更新单表统计&#10;ANALYZE;         -- 更新所有表&#10;&#10;-- 问题 2：Seq Scan 在大表上 → 缺少索引或索引失效&#10;-- 检查 WHERE 条件列是否有索引&#10;-- 检查是否有函数/类型转换导致索引失效&#10;&#10;-- 问题 3：Sort 节点耗时大 → 缺少排序索引&#10;-- Sort  (cost=...)  Sort Method: external merge  Disk: 102400kB&#10;-- 解决：为 ORDER BY 列创建索引&#10;&#10;-- 问题 4：Hash 节点内存溢出 → work_mem 不足&#10;-- Hash  (cost=...)  Batches: 8  Memory Usage: 32768kB&#10;-- 解决：SET work_mem = &#39;256MB&#39;; （会话级别调整）&#10;&#10;-- 问题 5：大量 Heap Fetches → 索引不覆盖或 VACUUM 不足&#10;-- 解决：创建覆盖索引或运行 VACUUM&#10;VACUUM ANALYZE orders;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> diagnosisPatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 问题 1：估算行数严重偏差 → 需要更新统计信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ANALYZE orders;  -- 更新单表统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ANALYZE;         -- 更新所有表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 问题 2：Seq Scan 在大表上 → 缺少索引或索引失效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 检查 WHERE 条件列是否有索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 检查是否有函数/类型转换导致索引失效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 问题 3：Sort 节点耗时大 → 缺少排序索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Sort  (cost=...)  Sort Method: external merge  Disk: 102400kB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 解决：为 ORDER BY 列创建索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 问题 4：Hash 节点内存溢出 → work_mem 不足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Hash  (cost=...)  Batches: 8  Memory Usage: 32768kB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 解决：SET work_mem = '256MB'; （会话级别调整）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 问题 5：大量 Heap Fetches → 索引不覆盖或 VACUUM 不足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 解决：创建覆盖索引或运行 VACUUM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VACUUM ANALYZE orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>诊断流程的核心思路：先看总耗时定位瓶颈节点，再看该节点的扫描类型和行数，最后对症下药（加索引、更新统计、调参数）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>EXPLAIN ANALYZE 是性能诊断的第一步，BUFFERS 选项帮助定位 I/O 瓶颈</li>\n<li>扫描类型选择取决于选择率：&lt; 5% 用 Index Scan，5-20% 用 Bitmap Scan，&gt; 20% 用 Seq Scan</li>\n<li>连接算法三选一：Nested Loop（小结果集+索引）、Hash Join（大表等值）、Merge Join（已排序）</li>\n<li>估算行数与实际行数的偏差表示统计信息过时，需要运行 ANALYZE</li>\n<li>Rows Removed by Filter 值很大说明缺少索引，数据在表扫描后才被过滤</li>\n<li>work_mem 不足导致排序和哈希溢出到磁盘，按需在会话级别调整</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"执行计划解读","id":"执行计划解读"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"扫描算子","id":"扫描算子"},{"level":2,"text":"连接算子","id":"连接算子"},{"level":2,"text":"关键指标解读","id":"关键指标解读"},{"level":2,"text":"常见性能问题诊断","id":"常见性能问题诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"索引策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/performance-tuning/index-strategy"},"next":{"title":"查询优化实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/performance-tuning/query-optimization"}}